# Ignore everything, then name what belongs in the repository. The
# allow-list had only theories, ML and ROOT -- which silently left
# src/document/root.tex OUT, even though ROOT declares
# `document_files "root.tex"`. A fresh clone therefore could not build
# the document at all.
*
!*/
!*.thy
!*.ML
!*ROOT
# The document driver ROOT names, plus any bibliography it grows.
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.sty
# Prose that belongs to the development: README, todo, port notes.
!*.md
!todo
!Makefile
!.gitignore
